<div class="c"><h1 class="redstar">Poetry By:Jas</h1></div><h2 class="c">ANGEL</h2><p>Take me away with you <br>Take me with you to the moon <br>And from there we can look down <br>Upon others true love<br>Take me into the sunset for the first time <br>It will be the last time <br>When I melt into you <br>Take me to a place <br>Where no one would dream of going <br>And there is where we can make <br>All of our dreams come true<br></p><hr width="50%" class="redstar"></body>
